      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A skeleton in mixed hill-clan and Academy remnants, bone shards orbiting its skull, wielding a rusted hill-clan axe.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.94wLkbfz0zc6czXz]{05. The Ossuary Wall}.</strong> A creature that dies within 60 feet of the skulltaker rises as this skeletal champion in 1d4 rounds unless it succeeds at a DC 40 Will save (Bonetaker). Bonetaker names the Monster Core skeletal champion, a level 2 creature; it adds bodies to the fight, not threat. At party level 18 the four antiquarians rise on round 2.</p>"
